{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>StarFront:</strong>\u00a0<strong>Lancers</strong> is an action space shooter.  You take control of a wing of three Heroes to take part in intense and challenging dogfights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For now there will be just three game-modes, but I plan to add more:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY CAMPAIGN</strong>: Space Opera Story Campaign.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROGUE-LIKE MODE:</strong> Travel throughout the solar system encountering ever increasing challenges.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENDLESS ARENA:</strong>\u00a0Test your skills against infinite waves of enemies to climb the global leader-boards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HERO COLLECTOR:</strong> Each ship is tied to a unique character unlocked through gameplay. They can be levelled up, modified, and customised with new weaponry and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming soon, please wishlist!\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3757940?t=1759813033","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757940/dd2609c58148b4a25e4b5dacc7dfbf022b66fabc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759813033","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757940/474a70867eba220190a1198d2b099e061d858bb4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759813033","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757940/474a70867eba220190a1198d2b099e061d858bb4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759813033","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<